  (text "FRONT PANEL: 7 buttons, data knob, LCD connector\nButtons: 12 mm tactile switches with snap-on caps (Joey, Oct 24). Each shorts its Pico pin to GND; the Pico's pull-ups are on.\nData knob: turn-only encoder with 10k pull-ups and 10nF filters for clean steps.\nLCD: HiLetgo 20x4 HD44780 blue LCD with a PCF8574 I2C backpack, 5V, address 0x27 (or 0x3F).\nThe LCD connector's pin order matches the backpack's GND, VCC, SDA, SCL. Make a short 4-wire cable, JST XH to Dupont.\nThe BSS138 pair shifts I2C between the Pico's 3.3V and the backpack's 5V. Keep the LCD cable away from the audio corner." (at 25.4 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top))
    (uuid ea05b938-ccca-58e2-9c5e-800b622ac98e)
  )
)
